{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cggt6PkJ4oSxVtMsLPdsv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For ZnO:Ni²⁺ I get **Dq ≈ 515 cm⁻¹ and B ≈ 790 cm⁻¹**, so C = 4.5B ≈ 3 555 cm⁻¹. I solved the two band equations by hand rather than with the fitting tools.\n\n**Approach: treat tetrahedral d⁸ like octahedral d²**\n\nTetrahedral d⁸ has two holes, and the tetrahedral field has the opposite sign to an octahedral one. These two sign changes cancel, so tetrahedral d⁸ behaves like octahedral d². The ground state is ³T₁(F), and the triplet levels come out as follows:\n\n- From ³F: ³T₁ at −6Dq, ³T₂ at +2Dq, ³A₂ at +12Dq.\n- From ³P (at 15B): a second ³T₁. The two ³T₁ states mix through the 2×2 matrix [[−6Dq, 4Dq], [4Dq, 15B]].\n\nThis gives two transition energies:\n\n- ν(³T₂) = 5Dq − 7.5B + ½√(225B² + 180B·Dq + 100Dq²)\n- ν(³T₁(2)) = √(225B² + 180B·Dq + 100Dq²)\n\nNeither ν expression contains C, so the C/B = 4.5 ratio is only needed to quote C.\n\n**Solving with the observed bands**\n\n1. Put the 15 500 cm⁻¹ band into the first equation: 4 400 = 5Dq − 7.5B + 7 750. This rearranges to Dq = 1.5B − 670.\n2. Substitute that into the second equation: 15 500² = 225B² + 180B·Dq + 100Dq². This becomes 720B² − 321 600B − 195 360 000 = 0.\n3. The positive root is B ≈ 790 cm⁻¹. Then Dq ≈ 515 cm⁻¹ (so 10Dq ≈ 5 150 cm⁻¹), and C = 4.5B ≈ 3 555 cm⁻¹.\n\n**Check:** these parameters give back 4 400 and 15 500 cm⁻¹ exactly, since two bands fix two unknowns. B is about 76% of the free-ion Ni²⁺ value (about 1 040 cm⁻¹), which suggests a fairly covalent Ni–O bond in ZnO.\n\n{\"Dq\": 515, \"B\": 790, \"C\": 3555, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Tetrahedral d8 solved like octahedral d2 using the 3T2 and 3T1(P) band equations, with C = 4.5B.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8024,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8024,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c1512d2-9a79-46bb-bb09-4ccb270055b9","uuid":"bc6db251-d7f6-47b9-9c13-0ecb9c987ce0","timestamp":"2026-11-03T23:43:25.786Z","request_id":"req_011Cggt6PQxecDZ2LU3nvM4c"}
